    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi</div><div>An example where reduce.capthist (specifically reduce.traps) doesn&#39;t correctly handle sightings. You may need to first &#39;reduce&#39; the capthist (not including markocc), assign a reduced markocc to the reduced capthist, independently compress the Tu and Tm matrices,and then addSightings. In your case (138 detectors, 72 occasions) I think this works to compress Tu by 2:<br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">Tu</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> apply</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">array</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Tu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dim </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">138</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">36</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div>Murray</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
