 style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">3</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></div></code></div>Murray</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><br>On Tuesday, January 8, 2019 at 2:02:45 PM UTC+13, <a rel=\"nofollow\">matt.wa...@gmail.com</a> wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><pre style=\"overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12.6px;padding-left:1em;padding-right:1em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87);background-color:rgb(247,247,249)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic\"></span><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/graphics/plot.html\" style=\"color:rgb(65,131,196);background-position:0px 0px\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/graphics/plot.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792487469880000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3cBSMFTRU7ELOGgGFmygvc\"></a><span></span><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/cran/secr/man/traps.html\" style=\"color:rgb(65,131,196);background-position:0px 0px\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/cran/secr/man/traps.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792487469880000&amp;usg=AOvVaw29DRFcLbjCGlrUxoezKE3F\"></a><span></span><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/cran/secr/man/secrdemo.html\" style=\"color:rgb(65,131,196);background-position:0px 0px\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/cran/secr/man/secrdemo.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792487469880000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0_PwKvGJcgR9Aeo6hB_LbB\"></a><span></span><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/graphics/plot.html\" style=\"color:rgb(65,131,196);background-position:0px 0px\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-safered